>\n      <b style=\"font-size:14px;flex:1\">2026 Product Roadmap</b>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-outline\">Save Draft</button>\n      <span style=\"position:relative\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"background:var(--brand-hover);transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 6px 14px rgba(99,102,241,.35)\">Publish</button>\n        <i class=\"hover-cursor\" style=\"right:-3px;bottom:-13px\"></i>\n      </span>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:18px\">Hovering: color change + slight lift, signaling “clickable”</div>","<div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;justify-content:center;align-items:flex-start;padding-top:6px\">\n      <div style=\"width:150px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/cover-mountain.png\" style=\"width:100%;height:54px;object-fit:cover;display:block\" alt=\"\">\n        <div style=\"padding:7px 10px 9px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">Hiking Trail Guide</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:2px\">2.3k reads · 3 days ago</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;width:150px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 10px 22px rgba(29,33,41,.16)\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/cover-workspace.png\" style=\"width:100%;height:54px;object-fit:cover;display:block\" alt=\"\">\n        <div style=\"padding:7px 10px 9px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">Desk Setup Ideas</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:2px\">8.1k reads · Yesterday</div></div>\n        <i class=\"hover-cursor\" style=\"right:12px;bottom:10px\"></i>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:440px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:7px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\"><span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px\">📄 PRD v3.md</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">10:24</span></div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:7px 14px;background:var(--bg-hover)\"><span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px\">📊 dashboard.fig</span><span class=\"icon-btn\" style=\"width:22px;height:22px;font-size:12px;border-radius:5px\">✎</span><span class=\"icon-btn\" style=\"width:22px;height:22px;font-size:12px;border-radius:5px\">🗑</span><i class=\"hover-cursor\" style=\"left:46px;bottom:-4px\"></i></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:7px 14px\"><span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px\">🖼 cover-final.png</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Yesterday</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:10px\">Row hover: highlights the row, edit and delete fade in</div>","<div style=\"position:relative;display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding-top:36px\">\n      <span class=\"icon-btn\">✎</span>\n      <span style=\"position:relative\">\n        <span style=\"position:absolute;bottom:calc(100% + 9px);left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:var(--inverse-bg);color:var(--inverse-text);font-size:12px;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:5px;white-space:nowrap\">Save</span>\n        <span class=\"icon-btn\" style=\"color:var(--brand);border-color:var(--brand);background:var(--brand-light)\">★</span>\n        <i class=\"hover-cursor\" style=\"right:-4px;bottom:-13px\"></i>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"icon-btn\">⬇</span>\n      <span class=\"icon-btn\">⋯</span>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:14px\">Hover an icon button to reveal what it does</div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"trigger\"><span class=\"hover-btn\">悬停我</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"feedback\"><span class=\"hover-anat-chip\">变色 / 浮起 / 阴影</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"transition\"><span class=\"hover-anat-chip\">transition .15s</span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"trigger\"><span class=\"hover-btn\">Hover me</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"feedback\"><span class=\"hover-anat-chip\">Change color / float / shadow</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"transition\"><span class=\"hover-anat-chip\">transition .15s</span></span>","parts":[{"key":"trigger","cn":"触发元素","en":"Trigger","desc":"指针进入它的范围，hover 就开始了","desc_en":"Hover begins the moment the pointer enters its bounds"},{"key":"feedback","cn":"悬停反馈","en":"Feedback","desc":"变色、浮起或加阴影，要轻","desc_en":"Color change, lift, or shadow — keep it light"},{"key":"transition","cn":"过渡","en":"Transition","desc":"平滑的状态切换；时长应按任务、输入方式和动效系统设定","desc_en":"A 0.1–0.2s smooth switch, no jarring jumps"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"变色","en":"Color","demo":"<span class=\"hover-v\"><span class=\"hover-v-btn\">按钮</span><span class=\"hover-v-btn hov-color\">按钮</span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"hover-v\"><span class=\"hover-v-btn\">Button</span><span class=\"hover-v-btn hov-color\">Button</span></span>","when":"按钮、链接最轻量的反馈","when_en":"The lightest feedback for buttons and links"},{"cn":"浮起","en":"Lift","demo":"<span class=\"hover-v\"><span class=\"hover-v-card\"></span><span class=\"hover-v-card hov-lift\"></span></span>","when":"卡片提示可以点进去","when_en":"Cards hinting you can click through"},{"cn":"显现","en":"Reveal","demo":"<span class=\"hover-v\"><span class=\"hover-v-row\">文档 v3 <i>✎ 🗑</i></span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"hover-v\"><span class=\"hover-v-row\">Doc v3 <i>✎ 🗑</i></span></span>","when":"次要操作平时藏起来","when_en":"Secondary actions stay tucked away by default"}],"use":[{"t":"<b>提示可交互</b>：{c:button}、{c:link} 可在悬停时改变颜色或阴影","m":"hover-btn"},{"t":"{c:card} <b>悬停反馈</b>：可用克制的阴影、颜色或位移提示可点击；幅度应结合卡片密度和布局测试","m":"hover-lift"},{"t":"<b>次要操作悬停显现</b>：列表行的编辑、删除按钮可在常态降低视觉强调，但仍要兼顾键盘与触屏入口","m":"hover-reveal"},{"t":"<b>补充解释</b>：陌生术语或图标可配合 {c:tooltip}，并支持键盘聚焦与触屏访问","m":"hover-tip"}],"dont":[{"t":"<b>移动端没有悬停</b>：需要为 hover 内容提供触控替代方式","m":"tip-mobile","bad":true},{"t":"关键信息<b>只藏在 hover 里</b>：触控或键盘用户可能无法获取","m":"hover-hide-key","bad":true},{"t":"反馈幅度过大：<b>大幅缩放、旋转或跳动</b>会干扰操作","m":"hover-heavy","bad":true},{"t":"唯一入口<b>只在悬停时出现</b>：应保持可发现性并提供替代入口","m":"hover-only-action","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"项目卡片的“删除”入口只在鼠标悬停时出现，手机和键盘都找不到。应该怎样改？","options":[{"id":"hover-only","label":"保留悬停显示，并让入口出现得更快","feedback":"速度不会解决触屏没有悬停、键盘用户不经过鼠标的问题，入口仍然不可发现。","correct":false},{"id":"multiple-inputs","label":"保留克制的悬停反馈，同时支持聚焦和触屏入口","feedback":"悬停可以强化鼠标反馈，但关键操作还要能通过键盘聚焦和触屏方式发现并执行。","correct":true},{"id":"hide-on-mobile","label":"桌面继续悬停显示，手机端直接移除删除入口","feedback":"移除入口会让手机用户无法完成相同任务；应提供适合触屏的可见菜单或操作。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"A card's Delete action appears only on mouse hover, so touch and keyboard users cannot find it. What should change?","options":[{"id":"hover-only","label":"Keep hover-only visibility but make the action appear faster","feedback":"Speed does not help touch devices without hover or keyboard users who never move a pointer over the card.","correct":false},{"id":"multiple-inputs","label":"Keep restrained hover feedback and also support focus and touch access","feedback":"Hover can reinforce mouse interaction, but an important action also needs discoverable keyboard and touch paths.","correct":true},{"id":"hide-on-mobile","label":"Keep hover on desktop and remove the Delete action on mobile","feedback":"Removing the action prevents mobile users from completing the same task instead of providing a touch-friendly entry.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"请保留卡片轻微的悬停反馈，但“删除”不能只在 hover 时出现。让它也能通过键盘聚焦和触屏菜单找到，且悬停时不要上浮跳动。请分别用鼠标、Tab 和手机触控完成删除确认。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Keep a restrained card hover state, but do not expose Delete only on hover. Make it discoverable through keyboard focus and a touch-friendly menu without jumpy movement. Complete the delete confirmation with mouse, Tab, and mobile touch."}},"demoDetail":"<div class=\"hover-play\">\n    <span class=\"hover-live-card\"><b>悬停我</b><i>浮起 + 阴影 + 变色</i></span>\n    <span class=\"hover-live-btn\">悬停变色</span>\n    <span class=\"hover-dead-card\"><b>对照组</b><i>毫无反应</i></span>\n    <span class=\"hover-hint\">把鼠标逐个放上去，感受“能点”和“不能点”的差别</span>\n  </div>","references":[{"title":":hover 伪类","source":"MDN","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/:hover","title_en":":hover"}],"scenes":["按钮悬停变色","卡片悬停浮起","表格行悬停高亮","图标悬停出提示"],"en":{"demoDetail":"<div class=\"hover-play\">\n    <span class=\"hover-live-card\"><b>Hover me</b><i>Lift + shadow + color</i></span>\n    <span class=\"hover-live-btn\">Color on hover</span>\n    <span class=\"hover-dead-card\"><b>Control</b><i>No reaction at all</i></span>\n    <span class=\"hover-hint\">Hover each one and feel the difference between clickable and not</span>\n  </div>","use":[{"t":"Highlight a clickable card","m":"hover-btn"},{"t":"Reveal a short secondary control","m":"hover-lift"},{"t":"Preview link or chart detail","m":"hover-reveal"},{"t":"Support pointer users with an extra cue","m":"hover-tip"}],"dont":[{"t":"Hide essential actions behind hover only","m":"tip-mobile","bad":true},{"t":"Move the target so much that it becomes hard to click","m":"hover-hide-key","bad":true},{"t":"Apply hover styling to non-interactive content","m":"hover-heavy","bad":true},{"t":"Forget matching keyboard focus behavior","m":"hover-only-action","bad":true}],"scenes":["Button","Card","Navigation link","Chart point"],"sceneUI":["<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;max-width:430px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <b style=\"font-size:14px;flex:1\">2026 Product Roadmap</b>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-outline\">Save Draft</button>\n      <span style=\"position:relative\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\